1
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:18,420
I Want to End This Love Game

2
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,650
It broke.

3
00:01:44,650 --> 00:01:46,140
Rematch.

4
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:52,260
<i>W-We're still doing this?</i>

5
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:55,740
<i>Why?</i>

6
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:06,190
<i>Does Miku not feel any way about this?</i>

7
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:12,700
<i>Come to think of it, I think
 Miku moved to break it.</i>

8
00:02:13,350 --> 00:02:18,960
<i>No, she was pretty 
surprised right after, too.</i>

9
00:02:19,550 --> 00:02:22,050
<i>She must not have had 
any intention of kissing me.</i>

10
00:02:23,130 --> 00:02:24,740
<i>Right?</i>

11
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,050
<i>So then why are we still going?</i>

12
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,730
<i>Because she can't afford to lose?</i>

13
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:32,000
<i>Because she can't chicken out now?</i>

14
00:02:34,210 --> 00:02:38,430
<i>Miku's definitely acting weird today.</i>

15
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,810
<i>I don't get it.</i>

16
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:28,230
Episode 10
My Childhood Friend Is Unstoppable

17
00:06:04,550 --> 00:06:06,140
Did that get you?

18
00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:35,200
<i>Something's changing.</i>

19
00:06:36,810 --> 00:06:37,970
<i>It has to be.</i>

20
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:42,480
<i>I'm sure of it.</i>

21
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:55,710
<i>I did it. It happened.</i>

22
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:59,500
<i>Miku and I kissed.</i>

23
00:07:01,030 --> 00:07:06,580
<i>There's no way that doesn't
mean she likes me, right?</i>

24
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:10,540
<i>But...</i>

25
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:15,330
<i>something was clearly off.</i>

26
00:07:16,090 --> 00:07:21,960
<i>Love Game or not, 
she would never do such a thing.</i>

27
00:07:25,470 --> 00:07:29,020
Kanai East Middle School

28
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,910
Grandma...

29
00:07:34,610 --> 00:07:39,030
I kissed Yukiya for the first time.

30
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:44,780
At first, it caught me by surprise 
when our lips touched.

31
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:47,740
But I worked up the courage 
and did it over and over.

32
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:52,410
And then Yukiya kissed me back.

33
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,030
His face...

34
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:57,360
His heart was definitely racing.

35
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,550
He was definitely into me, right?

36
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:03,470
He's thinking about me now, right?

37
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:18,530
Yukiya never did it.

38
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:24,530
Yet I kissed him.

39
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:28,170
I already knew.

40
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:30,250
It's cute.

41
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:34,750
It's cute.

42
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:34,750
It's cute.

43
00:08:30,250 --> 00:08:33,190
<i>I knew he wasn't saying 
that about Akane herself.</i>

44
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:34,750
<i>But...</i>

45
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:36,960
<i>But...</i>

46
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:40,250
<i>Why didn't he say that to me?</i>

47
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:43,120
<i>I want it.</i>

48
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,260
<i>No!</i>

49
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,430
<i>I want it.</i>

50
00:08:46,430 --> 00:08:48,010
<i>Don't do it!</i>

51
00:08:48,010 --> 00:08:49,460
<i>I want it now.</i>

52
00:08:52,230 --> 00:08:53,730
I suck.

53
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:58,990
Why am I so not cute?

54
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:04,990
I Want to End This Love Game

55
00:09:04,990 --> 00:09:11,740
Aoharu Detectives

56
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:09,310
Let's all play dodgeball!

57
00:09:09,310 --> 00:09:10,330
I'm in!

58
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:11,740
Same!

59
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:13,290
What about you, Sakura-san?

60
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:16,250
E-Er...

61
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,980
I'm happy they asked, 
but I'm bad at dodgeball.

62
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:23,510
I'm just going to make it 
boring for everyone.

63
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:26,420
I-I'll pass.

64
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,220
Ah...

65
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:31,310
Okay. Sorry.

66
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:32,710
Let's just go.

67
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:31,530
Aoharu Detectives

68
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:36,340
Sakura-san never joins. It's okay.

69
00:09:32,990 --> 00:09:37,770
Aoharu Detectives

70
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:41,900
Sakura.

71
00:09:42,770 --> 00:09:44,440
Asagi-kun.

72
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,910
Sorry. Thanks.

73
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:51,880
There we go.

74
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,680
Sakura-san.

75
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:58,450
You should at least 
carry the bucket yourself.

76
00:09:58,450 --> 00:10:00,680
Everyone does it by themselves.

77
00:10:01,210 --> 00:10:03,090
S-Sorry.

78
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:18,390
Don't cry, Miku-chan.

79
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:25,690
As long as you're smiling, 
I can depart worry-free.

80
00:10:25,690 --> 00:10:28,230
Then I'm going to keep crying!

81
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:30,090
I'm going to keep worrying!

82
00:10:30,090 --> 00:10:31,870
Please stay here!

83
00:10:32,410 --> 00:10:36,370
Grandma, don't go, or I'll..

84
00:10:45,570 --> 00:10:48,810
I'm going to trouble Grandma again.

85
00:10:50,990 --> 00:10:52,980
Asagi brought a girl with him!

86
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:55,390
So what? She's my friend.

87
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:57,440
You have Mihashi and them with you too.

88
00:10:57,440 --> 00:11:01,040
We were gaming when they came here.

89
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:04,150
Asagi-kun, it's okay.

90
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:06,140
I don't have any games.

91
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:07,230
It's fine.

92
00:11:11,110 --> 00:11:14,200
Okay, since there's a lot of us, 
how about we play tag?

93
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,490
Sounds good.

94
00:11:15,490 --> 00:11:18,910
You're <i>it</i> then, since you joined last.

95
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:22,020
I'm <i>it</i> too, then, since I came last.

96
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:23,170
What?

97
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:25,050
That's not fair, having two <i>its</i>.

98
00:11:25,050 --> 00:11:26,750
Oh, shut up.

99
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,930
Here we go.

100
00:11:27,930 --> 00:11:32,340
One, two, three, four...

101
00:11:28,810 --> 00:11:30,830
Seriously?!

102
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:34,140
Oh crap, run!

103
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:36,220
Sakura, let's hit them from two sides!

104
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:37,830
O-Okay!

105
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:40,260
Surround them!

106
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,060
Okay!

107
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,060
Are you okay?

108
00:11:45,060 --> 00:11:46,870
Totally fine.

109
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:48,360
Hurry up!

110
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,490
Hold it!

111
00:11:51,070 --> 00:11:53,900
Th-They keep getting away.

112
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:56,960
You guys are both so slow.

113
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:59,870
I'm starting to feel bad.

114
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:07,500
You're all so fast.

115
00:12:08,990 --> 00:12:11,280
What are you laughing for?

116
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,340
You're weird.

117
00:12:14,060 --> 00:12:19,140
I'm just having so much fun 
playing with all of you.

118
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,980
Sakura-san, wanna hang out 
again tomorrow?

119
00:12:28,690 --> 00:12:29,960
But...

120
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,320
Wouldn't I be a nuisance?

121
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:33,680
Why?

122
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,990
Don't worry about it.

123
00:12:34,990 --> 00:12:36,350
Let's play.

124
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,530
Okay!

125
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:40,720
Bye!

126
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,130
See you!

127
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:45,100
Good for you. You made some friends.

128
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:47,420
Y-Yeah. Thanks.

129
00:12:48,310 --> 00:12:50,490
I've been thinking...

130
00:12:51,210 --> 00:12:54,870
You're cute when you smile.

131
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:01,770
I wanted him to say more.

132
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:03,970
I have to change.

133
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:08,280
So that I can stay by Asagi-kun forever.

134
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:10,070
What defines a cute girl?
A hardworking girl    
A polite girl    
A compassionate girl      
A cheerful girl                
A determined girl      
A smiling girl

135
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:14,240
And yet...

136
00:13:15,130 --> 00:13:18,450
Now I'm not cute at all.

137
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:21,500
I let my need for approval 
get the better of me

138
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:23,410
and tried to seduce him with a kiss.

139
00:13:23,830 --> 00:13:25,500
I'm so low.

140
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:28,120
I'm so low, and yet...

141
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,230
it made me happy.

142
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,730
I couldn't help but be happy.

143
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:42,350
I'm not cute.

144
00:13:44,810 --> 00:13:47,140
I'm not cute. I'm not cute.

145
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:52,690
I'm really not cute.

146
00:13:57,220 --> 00:14:04,220
Of course he'd never call me cute.

147
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:13,570
I want Yukiya to stay with me.

148
00:14:13,570 --> 00:14:16,970
I have to become cute.

149
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:30,050
You're cute when you smile.

150
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:44,160
Café

151
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:44,160
Café

152
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:44,160
It's Yukki!

153
00:14:44,930 --> 00:14:46,080
Yeah.

154
00:14:49,460 --> 00:14:52,850
Hey, it's past closing, isn't it?

155
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,290
I should get going.

156
00:14:54,290 --> 00:14:55,340
It's fine.

157
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:57,670
Hinako needs to rant. Let her talk.

158
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:58,880
Exactly.

159
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:01,190
This cake is on me.

160
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,990
Thank you.

161
00:15:06,770 --> 00:15:08,930
So hear me out, Yukki.

162
00:15:08,930 --> 00:15:11,350
I failed my audition again yesterday.

163
00:15:11,730 --> 00:15:14,440
For that web anime voice part?

164
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,370
Yeah, that.

165
00:15:15,370 --> 00:15:18,400
It was a huge opportunity, 
so I practiced so hard.

166
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:21,020
It's a tough world, huh?

167
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:24,420
I like your voice too, 
and I'm not being biased.

168
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,220
Thank you, Yukki!

169
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,130
Give me sympathy.

170
00:15:29,540 --> 00:15:31,800
Want two different colors 
of Puchimon, then?

171
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:32,710
They're pretty rare.

172
00:15:32,710 --> 00:15:33,890
Ooh.

173
00:15:33,890 --> 00:15:35,380
I'm good.

174
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:49,270
Hey...

175
00:15:49,270 --> 00:15:52,140
Actually, I have 
something on my mind, too.

176
00:15:53,950 --> 00:15:55,500
What is it?

177
00:15:56,280 --> 00:16:00,400
I can't figure out what Miku's thinking.

178
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:05,730
She just did something 
totally out of character.

179
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:09,950
And she had a serious look on her face.

180
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:13,050
I messed up, too.

181
00:16:13,050 --> 00:16:17,750
But what she's doing 
is so inconsistent...

182
00:16:18,710 --> 00:16:23,090
<i>That kiss must have been an accident.</i>

183
00:16:23,930 --> 00:16:27,250
<i>She must not have wanted that, right?</i>

184
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:29,220
<i>She must have wanted me to stop her.</i>

185
00:16:29,850 --> 00:16:34,060
<i>But there's no way I could have 
stopped after what she did to me.</i>

186
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:37,370
<i>No...</i>

187
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:39,400
<i>I knew something was up with Miku.</i>

188
00:16:40,030 --> 00:16:41,990
<i>It was my fault for playing along.</i>

189
00:16:42,950 --> 00:16:44,770
<i>I keep making excuses.</i>

190
00:16:45,190 --> 00:16:46,810
<i>I'm so lame.</i>

191
00:16:48,990 --> 00:16:51,660
What should I have done?

192
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:55,270
What does Miku want right now?

193
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:57,420
What's correct?

194
00:16:58,050 --> 00:17:00,550
I have so much to think about.

195
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:11,560
Setting aside what's correct, 
what is it that you want?

196
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:16,020
I want to hear what Miku has to say.

197
00:17:18,150 --> 00:17:24,240
Puberty's a time of mixed emotions, 
especially for girls.

198
00:17:24,650 --> 00:17:26,850
Like that mille-feuille there.

199
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:32,320
You have trouble even expressing 
all the overflowing emotions.

200
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:35,040
Sometimes they become too much, 
and you get crushed.

201
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:38,760
So give her time and be by her side

202
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:41,130
until she can sort through her feelings.

203
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:54,300
Come on, the ice cream is going to melt.

204
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:55,520
Right.

205
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:57,320
Thanks.

206
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,860
Onii!

207
00:18:04,860 --> 00:18:07,610
Where'd my gym uniform go?

208
00:18:07,610 --> 00:18:09,920
You didn't take out the laundry!

209
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,380
I put it in the dryer!

210
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,740
I'm heading out, now.

211
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:15,380
What? You're leaving already?

212
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:23,010
Okay.

213
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:37,910
<i>Maybe she already left?</i>

214
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:46,610
Miku

215
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:09,100
<i>Miku...</i>

216
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:19,180
Disconnected
Disconnected
What's wrong, Miku?                        
\
Are you home right now?                                  
Hey!

217
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:31,200
Disconnected
Disconnected
Disconnected
What's wrong, Miku?               
Are you home right now?                  
    Hey!

218
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:31,200
Miku

219
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:31,200
Today

220
00:19:42,410 --> 00:19:44,830
H-Hey...

221
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:49,000
Asagi-kun?!

222
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,850
What's wrong? You never talk to me!

223
00:19:51,850 --> 00:19:54,290
Yeah, no, yeah, I mean...

224
00:19:56,290 --> 00:20:00,270
Do you know what Miku's up to today?

225
00:20:01,350 --> 00:20:05,940
She said this morning that 
she's staying home with a fever.

226
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:09,470
D-Did she?

227
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:11,990
She never told you?

228
00:20:11,990 --> 00:20:13,340
She hasn't.

229
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:17,780
She isn't responding to my calls either.

230
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:23,000
Why would she ever miss your calls?

231
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,920
Ohagi

232
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:26,910
I'm... gone.

233
00:20:26,910 --> 00:20:29,680
Has something happened to Miku?!

234
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:32,630
Ohagi

235
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:32,630
No, I don't think it's
anything like that.

236
00:20:34,220 --> 00:20:40,640
Miku

237
00:20:36,970 --> 00:20:40,640
Call Connected

238
