Mute

240
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:40,320
<i>Nacchan? What's up?</i>

241
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,630
M-M-Miku!

242
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:42,700
Are you okay? Are you alive?

243
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:43,690
Should I call an ambulance?

244
00:20:43,690 --> 00:20:45,150
I should! I'm doing it!

245
00:20:45,150 --> 00:20:47,000
<i>Wait, wait.</i>

246
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,850
<i>What's wrong? What's going on?</i>

247
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:50,690
<i>I'm fine, I'm fine.</i>

248
00:20:50,690 --> 00:20:53,200
<i>I just have a bit of a fever.</i>

249
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,780
<i>I'll be back at school tomorrow.</i>

250
00:20:55,780 --> 00:21:00,330
Oh, thank goodness, what a relief.

251
00:21:00,330 --> 00:21:06,370
Asagi-kun was so worried 
about you that he talked to me!

252
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:08,150
He never does that!

253
00:21:08,150 --> 00:21:10,550
O-Oh, okay.

254
00:21:10,550 --> 00:21:11,850
Sorry.

255
00:21:11,850 --> 00:21:13,630
Tell him I'm okay.

256
00:21:14,260 --> 00:21:16,420
Got it. Take care.

257
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:19,900
Asagi-kun, Miku's safe.

258
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:25,560
Asagi-kun?!

259
00:21:32,660 --> 00:21:35,770
<i>What does she mean, she's okay?</i>

260
00:21:37,490 --> 00:21:38,590
<i>Her voice...</i>

261
00:21:40,410 --> 00:21:43,180
<i>That's her voice after
she's been crying!</i>

262
00:21:44,830 --> 00:21:47,030
<i>I...</i>

263
00:21:49,710 --> 00:21:51,470
<i>I made her cry!</i>

264
